293|
294|                    // We are done handling the deflate block header. Now copy
295|                    // all or almost all of the remaining compressed data that
296|                    // has been processed so far. Don't copy one byte at the
297|                    // end if it contains bits from the next deflate block or
298|                    // pad bits at the end of a deflate block.
299|
300|                    // mix is 1 if we are at the end of a deflate block, and if
301|                    // some of the bits in the last byte follow this block. mix
